{"id":"wb-4-209","name":"广州沙面建筑群","title":"广州沙面建筑群","status":"catalogue","text":"广州沙面建筑群位于广东省广州市，是全国重点文物保护单位。名录记载的时代为清，文物类型为近现代重要史迹及代表性建筑，本条按第四批名录收录。","sourceUrl":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/shuju/1996/gwyb199636.pdf","sourceName":"公布名录","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1763be4f5e9c3acab6bd63f6.jpg","title":"广州沙面建筑群 01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E6%B2%99%E9%9D%A2%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"DragonSamYU","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNGD-020-003","width":320,"height":482,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}